      <details class="card group cursor-pointer"><summary class="font-semibold text-primary hover:text-accent">Do you offer custom Thymosin Beta-4 configurations?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">Yes. Standard kit is 5mg × 10 vials. Custom mg per vial and vial count available for qualifying wholesale orders. Contact us for a custom quotation including private-label options.</p></details>
